      "create_from_template": {
        "action": "create_from_template",
        "example": {
          "action": "create_from_template",
          "avID": "<avID>",
          "blockID": "<blockID>",
          "templateID": "<templateID>",
        },
        "fullDocResource": "siyuan://help/action/av/create_from_template",
        "guidance": [
          "Explicit viewID selects only the read target; it never switches the database carrier. Returned viewID and selectionSource identify the actual selection; selectionFallback reports kernel-default fallback.",
          "filters:[] and sorts:[] clear settings; group:{field:""} clears grouping. columnOrder includes every current view field, including hidden fields. Duplicate IDs, null and unknown settings are rejected.",
          "Filter leaves use column/operator/value and omit combination/filters. Group nodes use only combination and filters; never mix group and leaf fields in one node.",
          "Relation values use set_relation, not set_cells; two-way relations may write another database. create_from_template can create a document and stays separate from add_rows.",
          "Follow enabled nextSteps using real returned IDs. Completed pages never suggest another page. Writes always require user intent and the applicable strict preflight.",
        ],
        "hint": "Dangerous native creation using an existing template. itemID in the result is the AV row identity; blockID is the separate bound block/document identity. MCP preflights all default fields and relation targets, then reads every requested default back. Document templates require an explicit saveLocation so the target notebook can be authorized; inherited global document location is intentionally not guessed.",
        "parameters": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "description": "Create one AV item from a native new-item template. The returned itemID is the AV row identity; blockID is the distinct bound document/block identity.",
          "properties": {
            "action": {
              "const": "create_from_template",
              "type": "string",
            },
            "avID": {
              "description": "Attribute view ID",
              "pattern": "^\\d{14}-[a-z0-9]{7}$",
              "type": "string",
            },
            "blockID": {
              "description": "Materialized database block; never an AV row item ID",
              "pattern": "^\\d{14}-[a-z0-9]{7}$",
              "type": "string",
            },
            "groupID": {
              "description": "Optional target group ID",
              "pattern": "^\\d{14}-[a-z0-9]{7}$",
              "type": "string",
            },
            "previousID": {
              "description": "Optional preceding AV row item ID",
              "pattern": "^\\d{14}-[a-z0-9]{7}$",
              "type": "string",
            },
            "templateID": {
              "description": "Existing native new-item template ID",
              "pattern": "^\\d{14}-[a-z0-9]{7}$",
              "type": "string",
            },
            "viewID": {
              "description": "Optional exact view placement context",
              "pattern": "^\\d{14}-[a-z0-9]{7}$",
              "type": "string",
            },
          },
          "required": [
            "action",
            "avID",
            "blockID",
            "templateID",
          ],
          "type": "object",
        },
        "requiredFields": [
          "avID",
          "blockID",
          "templateID",
        ],
        "requiresConfirmation": true,
        "shapes": [
          "avID + blockID + templateID",
