        "hint": "Use either fromIDs + toID or fromPaths + toNotebook + toPath. For path-based moves, toPath must be the storage path of an existing destination document. Permissions: it is a delete-level operation, so every notebook involved (source and destination) needs rwd; check with notebook(action="list"). This action requires explicit user confirmation.",
