          "hint": "Use deckID + content blockIDs to turn existing blocks into flashcards; single blockID is accepted as a convenience alias. Non-built-in deck IDs must already exist. Document block IDs are rejected. This calls SiYuan's addRiffCards flow, writes custom-riff-decks, verifies the binding, and creates deck records together.",
