          "fs(action="rm") and fs(action="mv") require explicit user confirmation before execution.",
        ],
        "hint": "Moves or renames a document using human-readable paths. It is a delete-level operation: every notebook involved (source and destination, also for a rename within one notebook) needs rwd. This action requires explicit user confirmation.",
