    "description": "🕓 Document and global snapshot nodes: list, create, compare a document against a node, and (when enabled) delete nodes or roll back.
Actions (required fields): list_nodes(scope) · create_node(name, scope) · compare_node(documentId, tag) · delete_node*(tag) · rollback_document*(documentId, tag) · rollback_block*(documentId, tag, changeKey)
* = ask the user to confirm first. action="help" (topic=<action>) returns optional fields, nested shapes, and examples.",
    "overview": {
      "actionSummaries": {
        "compare_node": "Compares the tagged historical node with a newly created current-state snapshot for one document. Changed blocks are paginated; includeUnchanged defaults to false.",
        "create_node": "Use scope="document" with documentId for a document node, or scope="global" for a node visible to every document. The returned tag is the stable identifier for later actions.",
